    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) (b) read with Section 25 A of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978,I, Dr. Harini Amarasuriya, the Minister of Education, Higher Education and Vocational Education, having obtained a report under Section 70C of the aforesaid Act, in respect of the KIU Campus (Private) Limited a company incorporated in Sri Lanka under the Companies Act, No. 7 of 2007 and bearing registration number PV66705 and located at No. 249/1, Malabe Road, Koswatta, Battaramulla, being recognized as a Degree Awarding Institute, do by this Order, amend the Schedule I to the Order made under the said Act, and published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1896/22 of January 07,2015, by the addition of the following condition (vi) in Schedule I.",
